* Alternative structure: self-cascode (composite) tail current source and bias
* diode. Each is two stacked NMOS sharing the ibias gate, raising the tail's
* output resistance without a cascode bias line; NMOS pair, PMOS mirror load.
.subckt ota_5t vss ibias vdd vinn vinp vout
XINP nleft vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.0 w=96 nf=12
XINN vout vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.0 w=96 nf=12
XLD nleft nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1.0 w=40 nf=8
XLO vout nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1.0 w=40 nf=8
XTB t1 ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=200 nf=20
XTT tail ibias t1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=400 nf=40
XBB b1 ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=60 nf=6
XBT ibias ibias b1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=120 nf=12
.ends ota_5t
